{"version":1,"content":"<p>JEDEC近日提前披露了下一代內存標準DDR6的部分設計方向。除了性能提升外，最引人關注的改變是：DDR6內存條的長度可能比現有DDR5產品縮短約44%，從而在相同的主板空間內容納更多內存。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587146.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:01.091176+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:09.485448+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:09.485448+00:00","content_hash":"8ebbf303073950918ec6b8f85ac0fb8c1f9368b3f26c2c365808e26b9d84d320","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}